<title>CHINA: Mirabell announces first final results.</title>
<headline>Mirabell announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   25.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  8.86 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    49.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		     392.61</p>
<p>    Company name		 Mirabell International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 22-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Footwear retailer Mirabell was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on December 6, 1996.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents interest earned by the group on cash received from applications for new company shares in December 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
